msgstr "Nin fura ɲɛ in ma dafa. Aw bɛ se ka dɛmɛ don k’a dafa ni aw y’a ladilan ani ka kunnafoni caman fara a kan ka bɔ fotow la minnu bɛ an bolo, walima ni aw ye foto caman ta ni diɲɛ bɛɛ ka Open Food Facts app ye min bɛ kɛ <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.openfoodfacts.scanner&hl=en\">Android</a> walima <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/open-food-facts-product-scan/id588797948\">iPhone/iPad</a>A' ni cɛ!"

