msgid "To evaluate your exposure to the <tag> food additive, you can browse our list of products that contain it. See the list of <nb_products> products with <tag> below."
msgstr "Walasa k'a jateminɛ i bɛ faralifɛn <tag> sɔrɔ cogo min na, i bɛ se ka dumunifɛn minnu kɔnɔ a bɛ, olu lisi lajɛ. Dumunifɛn <nb_products> minnu kɔnɔ <tag> bɛ, olu lisi filɛ duguma."

