msgstr "N'i ye nin dumunifɛn in dilannikɛla ye, i bɛ se ka kunnafonisɛbɛn ci an ma n'an ka <a href=\"https://world.pro.openfoodfacts.org\">dilannikɛlaw ka barodilan guansi</a> ye."

